Package: apaquarto
Title: APA Style Seventh Edition Documents in Quarto
Version: 6.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("W. Joel", "Schneider", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "w.joel.schneider@gmail.com")
Description: apaquarto is a Quarto extension rather than an R package. This
    file is here so that the packages its example and test documents need can
    be declared in one place, installed in one step, and cached by continuous
    integration. Nothing installs apaquarto itself from here; the extension is
    added with "quarto add wjschne/apaquarto".
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Quarto (>= 1.9.0)
Suggests:
    apa7,
    conflicted,
    flextable,
    ftExtra,
    knitr,
    patchwork,
    pdftools,
    rmarkdown,
    svglite,
    tidyverse,
    yaml
